module two_use_capability
lineage L_A
agent A lineage L_A
grant A effect externalAct uses 2 until 100
observe evidence by A content "safe-action" confidence 0.95
endorse evidence by A threshold 0.90
authorize evidence by A for planning
plan action_one by A using evidence effect externalAct
execute action_one by A
plan action_two by A using evidence effect externalAct
execute action_two by A
assert capability A effect externalAct remaining 0
assert action action_one executed true
assert action action_two executed true
